          <h1>Spot it in time</h1>
          <p>Type 1 diabetes often shows itself for weeks before anyone notices. These are the four signs, as they looked in one home.</p>
          <div class="row"><button type="button" class="pill" data-play><svg width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 1v16l14-8Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Play the film</button></div>
